This project is based on the qs project and developed using typescript. Two types are defined, and there are several knowledge points that are not well understood: type , Recode , Partial and Pick .
### The difference between interface and type
- Similarity: both can describe objects or functions, and can be expanded using extends
- Differences:
- type can declare basic type aliases, union types, tuples and other types, but interface cannot
```typescript
//Basic type alias
type Name = string | number;

// union type
interface Common {
    name: string;
}
interface Person<T> extends Common {
  age: T;
  sex: string;
}

type People<T> = {
  age: T;
  sex: string;
} & Common;

type P1 = Person<number> | People<number>;

// tuple
type P2 = [Person<number>, People<number>];
```
- Used in conjunction with typeof
```typescript
const name = "Xiao Ming";

type T= typeof name;
```
### Purpose of Record
Record is a tool class for TypeScript.
